* Blind ASM-HEMT model leaf for five-parameter extraction.
* All switches match the synthetic truth; only the five parameters below are perturbed.
.hdl "/home/edaagent/asmhemt101_6/asmhemt_nano_isothermal.va"

.model asmhemt_blind asmhemt
+ shmod=0
+ trapmod=1
+ voff=-1.5
+ nfactor=1.0
+ u0=100.0e-3
+ vsat=1.5e5
+ lambda=0.02
